      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I resort to mass deleting avatars and re uploading them to keep them up to date and sorted. hahaha I like to have sections that have the same type of avatar, so a folder and search system would be a much desired feature. \n\nI would like the image for the folder to be something that can be uploaded, and not based on a specific avatar preview. as that would result in extra server costs as people would upload avatars just to have as the folder picture. the Folder images could easily be set to a max of 256x256 resolution, The folders should be easy to sort and organize.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
